Most of the common ways of disposing of him really don't heavily
favour either handwear choice.

With a cockatrice corpse, any gloves will do.

If you poly into a black dragon and use #monster, you won't be wearing
gloves.

With sleep or paralysis, GoP are probably better, so you can dish out
damage as quickly as possible while he's immobile. Don't forget your
ring of free action if using paralysis.

With Drain life, GoDex are theoretically better, however with your
robe and Xplvl 14+ I'm fairly sure you can cast it at 0% failure even
wearing GoP.


If you're absolutely determined to go toe-to-toe with him in melee,
GoP are obviously better, but I strongly advise you to try a less
suicidal strategy.


